# WS2-07. spec/03 §6 and §7 (E10034): a borrow T? slot may not store a different lend
# parameter's value; that is E10034 (or a move out of a read-only lend). Expected E10034.
profiles: host
with: tok.clo
expect: reject E10034
contrast: slot = other; ==> slot = tok(idOf(other) + 1);
contrast-expect: accept
